Destin's round-2 answers (youcoded-dev docs/active/design/2026-11-04-narrow-screens/
narrow-screens-2.live.answers.json). Still workbench-only switches; the app is unchanged.

- Top bar: `plain` (pair's two buttons each side; dot + name + arrow as one
  button with one highlight, no count) and `lights` (plain + a row of tiny
  status lights for the other sessions).
- ☰: `hub` opens one panel with New session on top, open sessions, the five
  latest past chats with See all, and the places as a row of tiles.
- Pills: every chip in the compact row gets one shape; Remote is icon-only.
- Shortcuts button removed (Destin: "lets just leave the current row").
- SessionStrip budget +8 for the temporary switches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
